================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY CONTENT — paper PDFs, marker JSONs, page images, figures
================================================================================

The following directories contain or are derived from third-party academic
papers retained for reproducibility and educational/research use:

  Assignment01/papers_pdf/     — paper PDFs as published on arXiv / venues
  Assignment01/papers_json/    — marker-pdf parses of those PDFs
  Assignment01/papers_xml/     — Claude-optimized XML derived from the JSONs
  Assignment01/papers_pages/   — 150 DPI page renders for the explorer UI
  Assignment01/figures/        — figure images extracted by marker

These files are NOT licensed by the repository owner. Each retains the original
copyright of its respective publisher / author. They are included under the
fair-use research exemption for systematic literature review and academic
educational purposes. If you are a copyright holder and want a paper removed,
file an issue and it will be taken down promptly.
